### Section Integration Test - Manual HTTP Testing

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminToken = <replace with actual admin token>

### 1. Get All Sections
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections

### 2. Get Single Section
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}

### 3. Get Shelves in Section
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}/shelves

### 4. Create New Section
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "New Section {{$timestamp}}",
  "location": "Floor 1"
}

### 5. Create Section - Duplicate Name (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Electronics",
  "location": "Floor 2"
}

### 6. Create Section - Missing Field (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Incomplete Section"
}

### Save Section ID for Further Tests
@sectionId = <replace with actual section ID>

### 7. Update Section
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Floor 3"
}

### 8. Update Section - Change Name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Updated Section Name"
}

### 9. Delete Section
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Get Section After Deletion (Should Return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}

### 11. Bulk Create Sections for Testing
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Electronics",
  "location": "Floor 1 - Main"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Food & Beverages",
  "location": "Floor 2 - Climate Controlled"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "Household Items",
  "location": "Floor 1 - Side"
}

### 12. Verify All Sections Created
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections

### 13. Get Specific Section Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections/{{sectionId}}

### 14. Test Case Sensitivity
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section_name": "ELECTRONICS",
  "location": "Floor 3"
}
